    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1136730/extras/a9b2169c7d728df7f14c791f635fa410.poster.avif?t=1704663951\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1136730/extras/a9b2169c7d728df7f14c791f635fa410.webm?t=1704663951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1136730/extras/a9b2169c7d728df7f14c791f635fa410.mp4?t=1704663951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">COMBAT</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Combine melee/ranged attacks and movement skills together freely<br></li><li>Switch weapons on the fly to seamlessly string together combos<br></li><li>Launch enemies into the sky or wall splat for extended juggles<br></li><li>Dash, blink, and fling through the air with momentum</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Diverse weapon movesets and mechanics with unique playstyles<br></li><li>Varied enemies with distinct behavior<br></li><li>Layered soundtrack that gradually builds up with progression<br></li><li>Unlockable equipment and music</li></ul>",
